# Zauner Oblate (the coin): thin round wafer, body c, waffle grid o,
# bottom-right shadow O, k outline (art-style.md section 10). Spin = the
# disc turns about its vertical axis: full face, narrow, edge-on, narrow.
# The lit left edge and the O shadow on the right stay put in every frame.
sprite = oblate
size   = 12x12
origin = 6,12
hitbox = 1,1,10,10
anim   = spin frames=4 ticks=8 loop
